  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:12.550" end="00:14.050" ttm:agent="v1">I got to go</p>
      <p begin="00:13.830" end="00:15.740" ttm:agent="v1">Thousand dollar tee, number nine</p>
      <p begin="00:15.740" end="00:17.600" ttm:agent="v1">Thousand dollar jeans, hold my nine</p>
      <p begin="00:17.600" end="00:19.580" ttm:agent="v1">You don't know what I've been through</p>
      <p begin="00:19.580" end="00:21.080" ttm:agent="v1">What I've seen with my eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:20.840" end="00:23.090" ttm:agent="v1">Money come in, then I leave on the guys</p>
      <p begin="00:23.090" end="00:25.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">New glitter, stacked wrist, bust down on the watch (watch)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.930" end="00:28.480" ttm:agent="v1">How you at my shows, but then wanna see me flop?</p>
      <p begin="00:28.480" end="00:31.110" ttm:agent="v1">I done made a couple hits, and now another bitch talkin'</p>
      <p begin="00:31.110" end="00:34.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bulletproof vest, if he talkin' I 2pac him (ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:34.170" end="00:36.250" ttm:agent="v1">If you wanna run up on me, got a melon on me</p>
      <p begin="00:36.250" end="00:38.760" ttm:agent="v1">Harder, if you kick rocks then to throw a pellet on me</p>
      <p begin="00:38.760" end="00:41.420" ttm:agent="v1">Think you want to blick talk 'cause you want attention, homie</p>
      <p begin="00:41.420" end="00:44.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Got yo' bitch lip-locked, she release her stressin' on me (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.350" end="00:46.830" ttm:agent="v1">She said, &quot;Don't leave, how you gettin' money&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:46.830" end="00:49.520" ttm:agent="v1">&quot;Can't believe that you acting funny since the green&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:49.520" end="00:53.240" ttm:agent="v1">Now I put 'em in a coffin, put a red dot on the beam</p>
      <p begin="00:53.240" end="00:55.770" ttm:agent="v1">&quot;Don't go&quot;, I already wanna leave-leave-leave-leave-leave-leave...</p>
      <p begin="00:55.770" end="00:59.770" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
